{"id":"410573","name":"大酱汤","author":"政妈妈","authorId":"210653","desc":"","cover":"images/410573/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"豆腐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"金针菇","amount":"适量"},{"name":"茭瓜","amount":"半个"},{"name":"海带","amount":"适量"},{"name":"土豆","amount":"1个"}],"sub":[{"name":"大酱","amount":"2勺"},{"name":"干萝卜缨","amount":"适量"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"牛肉粉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"海带条洗净切段，角瓜洗净切片，胡萝卜去皮洗净切片，萝卜缨洗净切碎。","img":"images/410573/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"土豆去皮洗净切片。","img":"images/410573/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"金针菇剪掉根部洗净。","img":"images/410573/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"豆腐切小块。","img":"images/410573/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"准备大酱。","img":"images/410573/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"锅里加入水炖煮。","img":"images/410573/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"水开后加入大酱搅匀。","img":"images/410573/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入土豆。","img":"images/410573/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入胡萝卜。","img":"images/410573/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入萝卜缨。","img":"images/410573/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"加入海带。","img":"images/410573/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"加入豆腐。","img":"images/410573/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"最后加入角瓜。","img":"images/410573/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"加点牛肉粉。","img":"images/410573/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"加入金针菇煮熟即可，加点盐即可。","img":"images/410573/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品图","img":"images/410573/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品图","img":"images/410573/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"加入食材的时候先加难熟的，后加容易熟的。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}